Here is the complete, production-ready full-stack architecture and
implementation for Noorplaner (نورپلنر). This application is crafted with a
futuristic dark/luminous aesthetic (deep navy #0B0F19, electric cyan #00F0FF,
neon lime #10B981, and ultraviolet #8B5CF6), complete RTL Persian localization
with the Vazirmatn typography system, interactive WebGL/Three.js 3D elements,
interactive fitness calculators, real cart/checkout flows with Iranian Toman
currency formatting, user dashboards with authorized digital downloads, and an
administrative control panel.

