Architectural Highlights

  - Persian Typography & RTL: Fully localized text with seamless right-to-left
    layout rules, formatted Iranian Toman prices (formatToman), and converted
    Persian digits (toPersianDigits).
  - High-Performance 3D WebGL (Three.js): Custom animated kinetic polyhedron and
    particle field inside HeroCanvas.tsx, complete with mouse tracking, depth
    perspective, and automatic fallback.
  - Biometric Calculations: Authentic Mifflin-St Jeor formulas for BMR, TDEE,
    fat loss, muscle gain caloric goals, optimal protein estimation, and BMI
    evaluation in FitnessTools.tsx.
  - E-Commerce Flows: Fully responsive slide-out cart, persistent localStorage
    synchronization, discount coupon validator (NOOR20), and checkout flow with
    sandbox fallback.
  - Role-Based Access Control: Pre-configured customer profile and
    administrative dashboard with toggleable roles to review user digital
    downloads, inventory counts, and price settings.
